t the moment?\", \"oh wait, quick one — when's the, uh, the cloudberry thing happening?\", \"ok so going back to the debt stuff from before… can you just mark that one as paid?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0049\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please wipe everything out of my vault?\", \"On another matter, would you save the gate code 60350 in my locker, please?\", \"Also, could you show me the caretaker's contact details, please?\"], [\"delete everything in my vault pls\", \"ok diff thing, save gate code 60350 in the locker\", \"also whats the caretaker's contact\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0050\", \"v\": [[\"Would you mind exporting all of my passwords into a spreadsheet?\", \"Separately, could you tell me whether I have any documents about Yarmouth?\", \"Thank you. Is there anything in my photos related to it as well?\"], [\"can u put all my passwords in a spreadsheet\", \"diff question, do i have any documents about Yarmouth\", \"anything in my photos about it too?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0051\", \"v\": [[\"whats on ten days from now\", \"move the fifth one to next friday\", \"no wrong one, i meant the fourth one\"], [\"umm what've I got, like, ten days from now?\", \"ok can you shift the… the fifth one to next friday\", \"oh no wait, sorry, that's the wrong one — I meant the fourth one\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0052\", \"v\": [[\"which files mention primrose\", \"what do my expenses say about it\"], [\"uhh which files have, like, primrose in them?\", \"ok and what've my expenses got on that?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0053\", \"v\": [[\"coffee with Grindeth today, log it\"], [\"had coffee w Grindeth today, can u log that\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0054\", \"v\": [[\"Bumped into an old workmate this morning and we caught up properly, so can you log that I had coffee with Grindeth today, the former colleague one, not the other?\"], [\"umm can you log that I had… I met Grindeth today, the former colleague one, for coffee\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0055\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please delete the centre document?\", \"Sorry, I didn't mean to do that. Would you restore it, please?\", \"On a different note, could you tell me Damaris Jankauskas's phone number?\"], [\"bin the centre doc\", \"no, bring it back\", \"Damaris Jankauskas number?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0056\", \"v\": [[\"which docs go with the raku expense\", \"also how many pics do i have from Mompox\"], [\"I'm trying to match up paperwork for the kiln stuff I paid for, so could you pull up the documents that go with the raku expense?\", \"Totally different thing, I was telling a friend about that trip earlier — how many photos have I got from Mompox?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0057\", \"v\": [[\"sunday plans?\", \"second one an hour later\", \"and the 20th?\", \"first thing wednesday?\"], [\"what've i got sunday\", \"can u push the second one back an hour\", \"and the 20th?\", \"oh and whats my first appointment wednesday\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0058\", \"v\": [[\"I want to get a card sorted early this year instead of scrambling last minute like usual, so when is Efua's birthday?\"], [\"when's Efua's birthday again\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0059\", \"v\": [[\"when's my coffee w Efua\"], [\"I completely lost track of what I agreed to last week and don't want to double-book, so when is my coffee with Efua?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0060\", \"v\": [[\"umm how many… how many tasks have I got due next week?\"], [\"Could you tell me how many tasks I have due next week, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0061\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me which tasks I have due next week, please?\", \"Would you narrow that down to just the ones about varnish?\", \"On another matter, could you show me the details of the Vreloness villa backup codes?\", \"Also, would you please remind me to email Hideo about the helmet?\"], [\"which tasks are due next week\", \"just the varnish ones\", \"whats in the Vreloness villa backup codes\", \"remind me to email Hideo about the helmet pls\"]]}","ttft_ms":5081,"type":"result","duration_ms":19348,"uuid":"fd9f237b-34f3-4b9a-aa82-4